## 13. Explicit non-goals (repeat)

- Tour intake/submit inside modal
- Marketing-owned OTP or cookie write
- Iframe login on marketing
- Changing operator session

## 14. Open follow-ups (non-blocking)

- Whether portal home `/` should also host `?auth=login` (optional)
- Exact desktop breakpoint token (reuse existing Denali media query)
- Backdrop click dismiss vs commit-only close

